# Keep the private material and build artifacts out of the image build context.
# The Dockerfile copies only go.mod, go.sum, cmd/ and internal/, so this file is
# defence in depth: it also protects a future `COPY . .` from leaking anything
# that is private to the project (D-012/D-014).
.git
.github
.gitignore
.internal
TODO.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CODEBASE_SUMMARY.md
CONTEXT_CHANGELOG.md
docs
examples
testdata
bin
dist
report.html
report.json
*.exe
*.test
coverage.out
cover.out
.env
.env.*
